ts a task to collect it from you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Additional driver not accepted: press <b class="gd-ui">Sign now on this device (additional driver)</b>.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>An expired licence, a face that does not match or a renter who will not sign: do not fix it. Press Stop and call us.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-the-steps-one-by-one" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The steps, one by one</h2><div class="gd-phones"><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div>Car ready: fuel full or charged 80%, clean, extras in. <b class="gd-ui">Yes</b> or <b class="gd-ui">No</b>, with a note for Fleet.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/385"><img src="/guides/img/field-22-handover-02-car-ready-phone-7fef7a1d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="385"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div>Is this the renter? Compare the person with the name and photo on file.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/325"><img src="/guides/img/field-23-handover-03-renter-phone-b718388d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="325"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div>Original licence: name, photo and expiry match. A photo of a licence is not enough.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/405"><img src="/guides/img/field-24-handover-04-licence-phone-3a13ae57.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="405"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div>Card on File: you have seen the physical card with the same last four digits, in the renter&#39;s name.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/265"><img src="/guides/img/field-25-handover-05-card-phone-bb24ccc4.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="265"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div>Odometer: type the reading in km.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/265"><img src="/guides/img/field-26-handover-06-odometer-phone-9234054f.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="265"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div>Fuel or charge: slide to the level on the gauge.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/275"><img src="/guides/img/field-27-handover-07-fuel-phone-a5dec192.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="275"></div></div></figure></div></div><div class="gd-phones"><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div>Keys: how many keys and fobs you hand over. Use <b class="gd-ui">+</b> and <b class="gd-ui">−</b>.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/235"><img src="/guides/img/field-28-handover-08-keys-phone-8de46c31.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="235"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div>Photo set: 19 photos in order. <b class="gd-ui">Take</b> each one; <b class="gd-ui">Retake</b> if needed.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/405"><img src="/guides/img/field-29-handover-09-photos-phone-4a0e3d9c.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="405"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div>Damage: tap the car diagram where it is, choose Where and Type, then <b class="gd-ui">Add the damage</b>.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/605"><img src="/guides/img/field-30-handover-10-damage-phone-923e28fe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="605"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div>Tracker: it should say in place and reporting. <b class="gd-ui">Check again</b> if not. The car has to go anyway? Open <b class="gd-ui">The car has to go anyway?</b>, say why and press <b class="gd-ui">Release without the tracker</b>: an Admin is told at once.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/295"><img src="/guides/img/field-31-handover-11-tracker-phone-0107b84a.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="295"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">11</span><div>Renter reviews: the renter reads the summary of odometer, fuel, keys, photos and damage.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/365"><img src="/guides/img/field-32-handover-12-summary-phone-96736994.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="365"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div>Signatures: the renter signs, then you. <b class="gd-ui">Use this signature</b> for each.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/405"><img src="/guides/img/field-33-handover-13-signatures-phone-537ff2e3.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="405"></div></div></figure></div></div><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol" start="13"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">13</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Hand over the keys</b>. You see &quot;Checked out. The rental has started.&quot; The renter gets the photo report by email and in their Documents.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Photos wait on the phone without a connection and upload by themselves when it returns; the count shows what is still uploading. Each photo keeps its time, and the place when your phone allows location.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-sign-now-on-this-device" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign now on this device</h2><p class="gd-p">The renter (or an additional driver) has not signed the rental agreement yet? They sign on your phone.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the job, press <b class="gd-ui">Sign now on this device</b>. It shows who still has to sign and whether their licence is on file.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Check the person: the name matches their licence, and you saw the original licence. Tick both. No licence on file? Press <b class="gd-ui">Photograph: Licence, front</b> (and the back and the selfie).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Hand the device to</b> and their name. They read the agreements (CarmaCars&#39; and Blind Spot&#39;s), tick the statements and sign with their name or their finger.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">They hand the phone back: press <b class="gd-ui">Back to the staff view</b>. The signature record says it was signed in person, collected by you, on your phone.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-the-deposit-on-your-phone" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The deposit on your phone</h2><p class="gd-p">Deposit not taken yet? The ready check shows how to take it under the Deposit line. You never type a card number.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Card hold: hand this phone to the renter</b>. They type their credit card in Stripe&#39;s secure form and press the button with the amount.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">They see &quot;Hold placed&quot;: take the phone back and press <b class="gd-ui">Back to the job</b>. The ready check shows the deposit taken.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">A rental longer than the hold limit shows <b class="gd-ui">Save the card on this phone (long rental)</b> instead: Finance charges the deposit to that card.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">No credit card? When CarmaCars allows it, the renter pays the deposit by e-Transfer or in cash: record it under the Deposit line.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-add-ons-to-put-in-the-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add-ons to put in the car</h2><p class="gd-p">A booking may come with add-ons: a baby seat, a child or booster seat, flowers, an umbrella, a phone charger or a prepaid full tank.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the job. Under Put in the car you see each add-on, how many, and what to do (for example &quot;Put the bouquet on the front passenger seat&quot;).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Put every item in the car before the handover. The Car ready step lists them again.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Prepaid fuel: the renter may return the car at any fuel level. Do not charge for fuel at the return.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A chauffeur on the booking: Fleet tells you who drives and when.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>An item missing? Write it in the note for Fleet on the Car ready step and call the office before the handover.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>The photo count shows &quot;19 of 19 photos taken · all uploaded&quot; when the set is complete. The first photo must show the plate. Open circles on the damage diagram were recorded before; add only what is new.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('field', 'report-rentals-referrals-and-profile', 'chapter', 'photo-shoots', 'Report anything that happens on the road, add a rental for a renter you found, share your referral link, and keep your details up to date.

## Report a problem

1. Open **Report a problem** and choose the Car.
2. Choose What happened: **New damage found**, **Warning light**, **Collision while I was driving**, **Ticket or toll while I was driving**, **Lost property found** or **Something else**.
3. Write the Details: where, when and what you see.
4. Press **Take a photo** for each photo, then **Send the report**.

![](/guides/img/field-03-report-phone-2adac4d1.jpg "phone; size: 390 965; pins: 1 92.3 29.5, 2 92.3 37.3, 3 92.3 83.4, 4 92.3 97.9")

> Watch out: In a collision, make sure everyone is safe and call 911 if anyone is hurt. Then call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991 before you send the report.

## Add a rental for a renter you found

Your home address must be in your profile first: until it is, the page asks for it.

1. Open **Add a rental**. Choose the car, the dates and the places, then type the renter''s details. A renter already on file is found by their email. Car already out with the renter? Enter the pickup as when it left: it is recorded as on trip.
2. Press **Check the calendar and the price**. To charge another price, type it with the reason: a price far under the rate sheet is flagged for an Admin, not refused.
3. Choose **Send a payment link** or **Charge the saved card when the renter signs**. You never take payment yourself.
4. Under Who found this client, choose **I sourced this client** or **Entered for CarmaCars**, then press **Add the rental**.

## Commissions

1. You earn 10% of the rental charge (before tax, after discounts, less refunds) of each rental you sourced: one you added and marked I sourced this client, or a booking made with your referral link.
2. It is earned when the rental is completed and paid in full, then an Admin approves it and it is paid on your pay date. Your home address must be in your profile: until it is, a commission waits as not earned yet.
3. **My sales** shows each commission: not earned yet, pending approval, approved, paid or reversed. A refund after payment comes off a later commission.

## Referrals and profile

1. **Referrals**: your own referral link. Press **Copy the link**, or let someone scan its QR code. A booking made with it counts as a rental you sourced.
2. **Profile**: **Save my phone**, your home address (**Change my home address**), **Set up two-step sign-in**, **Change my password** and **Sign out**.

![](/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-56e58ae3.jpg "phone; size: 390 905; pins: 2 93.6 63.9")

## Sign in with your phone number

Quicker on a phone than a password: a 6-digit code by text.

1. On **Profile**, under Sign-in, press **Add and verify my phone number**, enter your mobile number and press **Text me a code**.
2. Type the code from the text (it usually fills itself in) and press **Verify**. Choose **My phone number (a code by text)** under Sign in with.
3. Next time, the sign-in page opens on your phone number: press **Text me a code** and enter the code. Two-step sign-in still asks for your authenticator code.

## Texts or email

On **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both** for the messages we send you. Texts need the phone you verified above.
